___NOTES___

Sealmetrics Tracking Template v2.0

Migrated to SealMetrics v2 tracker API:
- Uses t.sealmetrics.com/t.js instead of app.sealmetrics.com/tag/tracker
- Calls sealmetrics.conv() and sealmetrics.micro() directly
- Automatic SPA support (History API navigation)
- No duplicate pageviews — cacheToken ensures script loads once
- Removed: ignorePageview, superPrivacy (no longer needed in v2)
- Added: pixelUrl field for custom pixel domains

This template allows you to track:
- Pageviews: Basic page load tracking with optional content grouping
- Microconversions: Intermediate actions like add-to-cart, form submissions
- Conversions: Completed goals like purchases, leads, sign-ups

For more information, visit: https://www.sealmetrics.com
Documentation: https://docs.sealmetrics.com

